  "description": "Ho-Seok is a tiger who wants to make and sell cute desserts in peace. While he was once a member of a shady syndicate, he makes the decision to wash his hands of that life and instead follow his dream of opening his own dessert shop! But this new life isn’t as easy as it sounds. Can Ho-Seok overcome the prejudices his neighbors have against him and make his dream come true? A slice-of-life story to warm your heart!\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
